---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import SectionTitle from '../../components/ui/SectionTitle.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Our History | About Us"
  crumbs={[{ label: 'About', href: '/about' }, { label: 'History' }]}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container measure mx-auto">
      <SectionTitle title="Our History" eyebrow="1998 onwards" align="center" />

      <div class="prose mx-auto mt-5">
        <p>
          Northgate Academy was founded in 1998 by a group of educators with a shared vision:
          to create a school where academic excellence and genuine pastoral care go hand in hand.
        </p>
        <p>
          Starting with just 80 pupils in Primary, Northgate has grown steadily and thoughtfully.
          In 2008, we opened our Secondary section. Today, we serve over 900 students from ages 5–18.
        </p>
        <p>
          Throughout our growth, we have held fast to our founding values. We have never chased size
          for its own sake. Instead, we have invested in keeping classes small, maintaining strong
          pastoral systems, and ensuring every child is known.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our buildings and facilities have evolved over time, but our ethos has remained constant:
          learning is joyful, staff genuinely care, and every child belongs here.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
